{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>The chirping locust shall inherit.</b> The locust makes the fruit destitute." "<b>Shall inherit.</b> Impoverish." "<b>Chirping locust.</b> A species of locust. And it is impossible to explain יְיָרֵשׁ in the sense of inheritance — for if so it should have written ״יִירַשׁ״ — and not in the sense of dispossessing and driving out — for if so it should have written ״יוֹרִישׁ״."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:38.911000334Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}